@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Get all products (first call → MISS, second call → HIT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

###

### Get product by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Accept: application/json

###

### Get non-existent product (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

###

### Create product (valid)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Monitor",
  "description": "4K UHD 27-inch display",
  "price": 399.99,
  "stock": 30
}

###

### Create product – validation failure (empty name, negative price)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "description": "",
  "price": -10,
  "stock": -5
}

###

### Update product
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "name": "Laptop Pro",
  "description": "Updated high-performance laptop",
  "price": 1499.99,
  "stock": 45
}

###

### Delete product
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
